<h1 style="margin:0 0 12px 0;font-size:22px;line-height:1.3;font-weight:600;color:#0A0A0A;">Ordine confermato</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 24px 0;">Keus ha confermato l'ordine <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{orderCode}}</strong> per {{companyName}}, con consegna prevista il <strong style="font-weight:600;">{{deliveryDate}}</strong>.</p>
<table role="presentation" width="100%" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="border:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-radius:10px;border-collapse:separate;">
<tr>
<td bgcolor="#FAF7F2" style="background-color:#FAF7F2;padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#817B78;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-top-left-radius:10px;">Prodotto</td>
<td bgcolor="#FAF7F2" style="background-color:#FAF7F2;padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#817B78;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E1D8;">Piano</td>
<td bgcolor="#FAF7F2" align="right" style="background-color:#FAF7F2;padding:10px 16px;font-size:12px;font-weight:600;color:#817B78;border-bottom:1px solid #E7E1D8;border-top-right-radius:10px;">Postazioni</td>
</tr>
{{#each lines}}
<tr>
<td style="padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#0A0A0A;">{{productName}}</td>
<td style="padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#0A0A0A;">{{planName}}</td>
<td align="right" style="padding:12px 16px;font-size:14px;color:#0A0A0A;">{{seats}}</td>
</tr>
{{/each}}
</table>
<table role="presentation" cellpadding="0" cellspacing="0" border="0" style="margin:28px 0 0 0;">
<tr>
<td class="rk-btn" ${button_cell}>
<a href="{{orderUrl}}" style="display:inline-block;padding:10px 20px;font-size:14px;font-weight:600;color:#FFFFFF;text-decoration:none;border-radius:8px;">Apri l'ordine</a>
</td>
</tr>
</table>
